    "whatItIs": "Dialpad is an AI-centred business communications platform. Dialpad Connect is the core cloud phone scored here (Standard $15, Pro $25 annual per user/month; Enterprise custom). Support (~$80+) and Sell (~$39+) are separate products and are not treated as the Connect entry floor. AI transcription and summaries are included on Connect; power dialer depth lives on Sell, and stronger CRM/CTI starts on Pro+.",
